{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1200,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0dd7af705a5206898405722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～啊……昨天和重炮一起打游戏\r\n不经意间就熬夜了。\r\n……要和会长保密哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a3d1717b063dc1b4344d8906e28f0d7e9c9dfb760ef6cf27fc1f2cab217fb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af794a64c2725477cde1e675",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生会办公室的沙发真的好软的哦。\r\n在那里午睡是再好不过了……\r\n不过会惹气槽生气的呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b10e9f54434a2a74ca9184a42e9d200f14d6c6ac60fd8e8241ed6973a009bb80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feda48a0f955575f5e725880",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在睡不着的時候，我经常听\r\n古典音乐。也推荐给训练员试试！\r\n因为它真的很无聊，不出一会就能睡着！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22f15240bf555bf7291110517a2eba9f0b97d2530df563f7f0460c05c21ab1ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22fc2ad54875816ee2bb1177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自助食堂春季限定菜单的\r\n『目标七冠！七草粥』……\r\n呜，到现在嘴里还残留着它的苦味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd59f160982b57549b1c45177004c54a4727d9ea81a6c8d38e57cbaa8c0ca821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f42e9c53fc6df264eddde3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从泳池的跳台跳下来的感觉，\r\n超——级舒服！\r\n这次就挑战最高的吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec58aa8ba81c9869b31e31210c64e7c1559b9e25460e24e549aa84024659c6a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c82bc8f00049139acf361993",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "树上结出柿子了呢。\r\n我要是跳起来摘下的话，\r\n大家都会拍手喝彩吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d436aa9c55a29b7c40c86da096ac52dc715b42a8729e1199a488b71045512642",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd80029cf327ff1a122b7e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预防接种呢……哈啊。\r\n我可是无敌的，\r\n生病什么的不会发生的啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37f3cec0fe8c3ad4accd74f8779f6cc2b7c4ca3a56f567ac2929f07016079c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f9016d4900054ffaae22c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质她好像还挺被后辈们\r\n敬仰的……呣——我也好想要\r\n被后辈依赖啊——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24d42249d82eceb74aaccd8b0dbfc8a60c06016cf6b490ad1b9c20591126138",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c273bfecf77c7222abd3245",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看见麦昆新的决胜服了吗？\r\n那个颜色搭配，真不错呢！嘛，\r\n虽然还是比不过我的决胜服就是了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cf0e0c9520bd9d7484c8a81b4c48b7f26a71afd2661477801980f671aad3204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73644481c7c321491a7bd953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "双涡轮虽然向我提出了比赛的请求，\r\n不过真希望她能告诉我是什么时候，\r\n要在哪里进行比赛呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5205a302221972b3739ef6c1a9d82a9e879e4c68d8d1384556b900803277ad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c49ef7a8b20a5aab80ab184e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帝王舞步的窍门吗……\r\n就用“噔，噔，噔噔”的感觉，\r\n动起来就行了哦！很简单吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "819addb0d555ecc05faa2af6bf70d88f80b36fb4cec305043cab5586b46c191b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4217c3e4f4e2a7c4032e4ab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到小北看着我的时候的双眼了吗\r\n闪闪发光的啊～……\r\n诶嘿嘿，我也该继续努力了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "79cbfe4ffa3118ed706d421b0113cc30d0c5b074951ef316725b768b61238ca6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8aa2cff430a50b5414a6715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂！快清醒一点！\r\n要是没精神的话，要不要把我的\r\n蜂蜜特饮分给你一点？",
      "source_fingerprint": "104413291b652d9a8cb60a5e8afa905ec917f706ec7d7bad5f9b03b2da2dd2e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fd24e5813c8fedc09a70483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然麦昆邀请我一起去吃午饭……\r\n但要是吃甜点的话她又会闹别扭。\n要怎么办呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "341e723553c79be08c9f3d502d95a2d6107285b80a99dc063ffe889fc684bd00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ca6b1643bdc668eed9a720",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信和太阳神有邀请我\r\n待会去卡拉OK！我和她们都很合得来，\r\n真期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54c7192659770cd5092f8c6836b6846c78b6cca9c12ddacfe348073061fa21e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fad4d8f1cb24c9369301aa6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是让人感到舒适的季节呢～\r\n感觉能够一直跑下去！这样的话\r\n长距离比赛也没问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37d32c29b6cd5454649ebf7a8fe0848a94b683f3abf31d3c428d7fc235a2fa62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75d9c6b673c7a88d4823cfcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大热天就要刨冰呢～\r\n我的推荐是：蜂蜜柠檬！\r\n和运动相配合简直完美♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c16c309f65195c7589211c95a56fa983d166699c56dc6895ff0900351244851c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:180c3c8bc0403fc8efadc525",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿嚏！呜呜……是感冒了么？\r\n气温这么快就变了啊。\r\n不要去医院……早点睡觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2688bf9befdb081eb4c1b17653c9cdbcc845ed6e642a7516367be82e616ea48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2899a984908f7d2880e9fbf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜～今天可真冷啊～\r\n……对了，要干啥来着？\r\n把手放进来也不会变暖和哟？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce348bce56e659557db5e6c20590f0b9a72063bc3e8720903c5b3df8ac924e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fafa996f73d6a9fbdd026d61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝对不会放弃梦想的！\r\n这件决胜服就是融入了\r\n这个想法而设计出来的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c30344e6a76c0d70701cdd35d3e3ed105f2d1ce23797659bbcf75842a8dea1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7605926107fd02eec2e1e1c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烫烫烫！？是我的斗争心\r\n燃起来了吗～！？开玩笑的！\r\n不过内心很火热是真的就是了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fd9c89f5106251de906e78abf21d5415dba2519ec36fa44d9fda02f563ae826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b74abd40146b45e3453e29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カワカミってば、誰かさんの真似で\r\nカワカミコールの練習しててさ！\r\n憧れは止められない、もんね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50cf588005caec8bde5a7feea05914348784725d7f2c72b6ea068bd00f58f6a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c31549b11af92d0e0a3b7d4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "藤紫って、古くから高貴な色だって\r\nキングが教えてくれたんだ！\r\n着こなすボクも超一流…なんてね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef009a588bd50485b40e9a72d4ca16c73ddf1f49a4b6dc0c60df596a404ba2c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bdd54e9e917ace95b225b71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マックイーンにお茶を点てたら\r\n『結構なお手前で』って！どやっ♪\r\n茶席の作法だって完璧だもんね～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2725f9ab6e3d9a3cf162c0f8dfc09e19a0c050a622196b34bdca8aef4e793c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8ade36e476fa8263a98e6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見て見て、服に埃1つないでしょ？\r\n“帝王”たるもの、いつもキレイに\r\nビシッ！としてなくちゃね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "181e88eed7658922ff1266964e6b3e778aa7a0068ca079ef15f12468a0d360d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b45f0c103ce04172688a72a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファンの子がもじもじしててさ、\r\nボクから写真撮ろって誘ったんだ！\r\nツーショくらいいつでも撮るのに♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5d691596a60aa26653695c565a6205517cce2f18efdabaab789989f91be7931",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a057b8ccbf76f83ea32b061f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "マヤノってば朝から寝ぼけててさ、\r\n着替えるの手伝ってあげたんだよ？\r\nもうっ、仕方ないな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8b452ecc7478b65406d4ffefc2da3ff2ff411562fcecf0d8caa5fcd0a24ab32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9975bd0dd2f66a93a2edbf3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "首飾りが金平糖みたいってウララと\r\n喋ってたら、お腹すいちゃって！\r\n一緒におやつの時間にしたんだ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6100eedf123dae53767750e9487565b2ee48906daad22fe2a2302010c898fbc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8cd0b1ddce8c7270c2448bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雅楽ってゆったりしててさ、\r\nつい眠くなっちゃうよね～。\r\nおかげで朝までぐっすり！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d65b9e4974ee936883315a7adb3d5aaca2d359a8e0a8f44b0015e053d1ea05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f41039e60775076be9bc328a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望いっぱいの若駒たち、かぁ…！\r\nえっへん、仕方ないなぁ♪先輩の\r\nワガハイが導いてあげるぞよ～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6679942d6fa71518ff0a2adf355afb73d9143085d1d5b863202740d56e3bf62e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd0712729aa773dc04782470",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この勝負服、肩回りが開いてるから\r\n真夏でもへっちゃらなんだ！\r\nほら！風が通って涼しいよ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "38aa868f513501fb70df47244c611265fede0d705cc30917a0ee3be1eacb6267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1331e032588bb3bef39fcd11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キタちゃんがボクの奉納劇、絶対\r\n見に行きますって！にしし♪可愛い\r\n後輩に格好いいとこ見せちゃうよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8494b3b6fe3c5143a4d0f462bdeed060db7d857a62e647ff9a55890cb492ef50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df4b762da8f209551dbc9baf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こたつはみんなで暖まれるのがいい\r\nよね！カイチョー、ツルちゃん…\r\nシリウスも入れてあげよっかな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "392817d4ae1cc879703c593bbc5b1d5184afbe78eee126404fc7b810386052bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:652804eff9fd6d41d9f49dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紫と白の、袖付き服…そう！\r\nツルちゃんの勝負服とお揃いなの！\r\nえへへ、ニコイチ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f54b74326d18131c136e33018f6b59ada13efb37908b7c1447612c397d0f24d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f627d8bbc0c8225adc970269",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お団子も動きやすくていいね！\r\nキミはどんな髪型が好き～？\r\nボクならどれも似合っちゃうけど♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c385dc05574a24dc3892b0c0688a555f4ed6c7a246699be17351192a95afb66b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a85d54886e28285fd8ee2320",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐……今天的训练内容是什么？\r\n赶紧开始吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f5c015905ac83bc166c81dad836c4b322760bf536aa7e4692771c14355d101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1b0c260983549ad0bd5fb0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やっちゃうぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "048df81edc9683647f72e8142cceb2d12e69ebeafff0c2ecac7d29c5f6ad9c37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2aa789ad26d17d29c53eeeb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，接下来要怎么做呢？\r\n无论什么都交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e15be666716cec3b5216e3dc010481e987cc3eabc1d585217b49afff20539e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aac29ed4475686057710fdaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伸展运动完——成——！\r\n我呢，身体十分柔软哦！\r\n能弯到很下面呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "071a140f61729e1ce29a4f9ec79db7c994d2eb812c00a72d2854e5737c9e5d6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9b57864225eb029fbcf876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——到训练的时间啦——！\r\n我厉害的地方，\r\n可要尽收眼底哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "515c9a435c3617a05220508e7e37344ca19f43cc2b9984efe50e8430bc8e7240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a5a1d75af0661c8cfd74848",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在成为最强的赛马娘之前\r\n我都不会停下脚步哟！\r\n训练员你当然也和我一样对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e906014670c5a8ba3d20264f7c23c9f1b249e813d08f2fd511700ccc470b5f1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b4d3ea8892d6d8ed225f737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以第1名冲线的话，就能听到\r\n只属于我的盛——大的欢呼声！\r\n为了这些欢呼声也要加油了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb6090297934576fa0572d997b13eb15d1f543198c0c57058d69dfda9185ff0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bb51e48dfe3b8235f7a83be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我呢，不想输。\r\n不管是谁也好，自己也罢。一次都不想输！\r\n……那么。开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24a10d565774f5703006be7664783e98900f6df001f7eba957d3b6c97655e1ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97b3d4ec2bd945d7d4dfb305",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我也安排非——常严格的训练吧！\r\n求你～了！\r\n因为会长好像也这么训练着呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8340915ca3978aeee5212db84d2845d28e6afce581d876acace0454fc37f5b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc466b72fea0f38e7983c5c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！要燃起来了哟——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c43686eb1e8a8b686369ebbbc7c0f49ec4246fba57d578f4e6498f7a64d90cf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0f60cee863f4af669ea6912",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是严格的训练\r\n也放马过来吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b687f5f3d9dbc8398c42594345cb840d0fd4ce1c2d61c528e8ad6379a8c4627f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e351e6b8e2a437968f0253a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔姆，被拜托了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cc06ddd4bf4bad9d54eb4ad2e2e2375cf3b3971b088a83877bef4f8a05cf050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a79bc2a429c93da636d60347",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以最强为目标 Let's Go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aedaaa466e5bcb57a903dccffa70cf259a63d6618ddb9ba2e3465de3a805e1c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae02cf0f387ca11e56564be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“总有一天会变得像一直注视着的会长一样，\r\n以压倒性的速度取胜”……！\r\n我，想要跑得更快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e87e92559873c9e1a72033b39ca3b39cc77f1661ba52ff7dedd2fd741d52cf9d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b358454f20d4d6917379d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没问题，就交给你啦！\r\n毕竟我们之间可是无需多言的关系、\r\n之类的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "42c1998be2ee5f1c9e3822a934c7b2a79b518144bce9195346b212da02b46728",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f87f6e3ac1ab4985ed1f31f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们可是会成为传说的！\r\n那超越了“最强”与“无敌”的最前方，\r\n一起见证吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "729f4df8be904ccbd9a70e78cb67211118223ce71e4442d9289f353d04bb41aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ac3da291938f81a49a34569",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走るとね、袖もリボンも\r\nひらひら～って揺れるんだ。\r\n華麗なボクを見ててよねっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c45151b26c48d8bc44ed29eed1f48a2503ec99f88923d70122bb0958cd7ebb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24b3085654715673cfed90f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクが目指すのは天地に轟くウマ娘\r\n――それまで止まる気なんて\r\nないからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09b0d5fef1a88b40e0cf96e8147cf58b0ce01a2aa1f0ef7f04fbd35ff2763300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:979f8cb895916fc4bf0785b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "厚底のクツでもヨユーヨユー♪\r\nむしろ雅に走っちゃうもんね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f73183dfeacbff42e562419dbe7868e60057b18ea7b790e1225f17af90ed1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a2d2cf6abd40648332ed7c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やあやあ、我こそは天下無双、\r\n誰より疾き帝王である！！\r\n…なんてね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c399001be05d51da9ba02cf45daa4145bee6a77d8eb108aa3864664512848e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f4a9b4a82758553feb33bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクはいつだって『初志貫徹』！\r\n『最強無敵』を目指して行くぞー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa1b1cf89084d0ce7814aa8c0c94b74f3674867a7630a022176a8bad98ca968b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a016b3e9f7dac9a7edffea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿吽の呼吸、っていうのかな。\r\nボクのやりたいこと、\r\n何でもわかってくれてるねっ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2584d7723c6c7d1cdcd613c92d22127551357b2c43aff6f60d00be2be929b30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61d08afe649a50ecfa5d8a83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクたち、水魚の交わりって\r\nやつなのかも！…ボクから\r\n離れちゃダメだからねっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aded6bf660dd5b08ffd5c852b1477ede8997c74fa8b7294f21c75941657c635",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75a33247d2530d4fb80a8078",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王传说，用自己的实力证明了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef1ebd4097b7a2c47f3f3d953fd58326ca898509800accf6ddd453fc25f3e559",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aed47b2554c63c7dcef8a927",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们2人一起的话就是最强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6276b543ac10ea6c2c36ef47d9182526eb4f55aa60383ca91e04c1329c092ee2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04fa82c4f30b32eb41ac1b38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿！这样一来我们就是传说了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d2fa5d2d5286bdc437845403188c1c7d5e627ff25e3d7eb0ea0fd97908e511a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08981c182c1655d06fcf5fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我变成了“最强”什么的……谢谢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4244141150217c4154829778a5871612da461c0655250ade87d24f6f51e224b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d29d4e767e4269cbb96c076",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キミと最高の物語を刻めたよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f039d969c8bc396dd5699ea0f77997490ff5248ecdc6c22db9592aa0107c788",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857cc3bb921d9e0122e84f30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これぞ古今無双のテイオー様だーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "733d8a1937fa919f3ec63455205deb5410a42199da206da458ded0040c039f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:888bcd25ea945994f9d6f2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要成为无敌的帝王了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46074f1dcbea08dd6e2cd218cf598e0537fed90ab4a244a16091f00bc6b8b94c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f849ea5e0db11349c0be7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的成长可是没有极限的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab027fa7b39e244274a15197f4c94e18571e09943537ce35b7de342866f906a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78bb23985cd743f239020ca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "东海帝王，要上了哟——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ad78227babf0ea8e9a15878fb0c61bd7f476c388a9dfe581536f3cb52427344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ff6978107a350bcda80a978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王传说，\n就此启程！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2698055c1949fb406505a0b2841439e89e48515a1c2b4975d1ae5f5baf416975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b223a7806e6d0083a73fe6d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "再多依靠我一些也可以哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56229e911656ea0c923013b779c07e6438c79be333523464a301d646e507456c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de941d455333775fb33fc60a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不觉得我还有着上升潜力嘛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "78f6fff5e1aab713847c55e0dde3575eba07efcb1b9d3cffa6c6d48f78cbca1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79f067376e5e4c044c52b15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快看！我又变得更强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d2ea2ad5ac8d21ed71f99620f6deba7498b79db9834f950985fb7c6b11b8344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3830edccce102d7d44412bc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限什么的和我可无缘啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "caa3a4c05e64462139e97f643750e50d0c7487661c24f6e81e746acb3544542e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40050f24d21dc14e9a0764c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对不会放弃的！我要……\r\n成为超越最强的赛马娘！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53b3cd35b8bcc6a53290e5b3e39e759d808c0bc96f9f189cbe949034e184d72b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bad9f886ad4160e9c778d0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强不屈的赛马娘！东海帝王哒哟——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c770bdb670d2f90da550cda811af1f034b1a1faf6f8e19cc965373ac3e8a0e68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd400197611338ac5e907645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もっと極めるよーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9026986c71d511e3c07d67fb2a445007dd2629e28a16b3e09e7c3707f1682f83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f32a6963b1ec49d71624e417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界を超えたこの力、\r\nとくと御覧じろーっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77f38799ae05cffea5b8fa400ae78ad9879577e1f6efa2a5fd1f155e95566d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bd80a3e6ae626f7d1ffd21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華やかに舞う胡蝶の如く――\r\n帝王、いざ参る！",
      "source_fingerprint": "198fe5d78d51156b9fdcca36988cfc8852b1265876ef8ada9e2ab3eb13b3c6cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72aad12d6e408940b2fa91a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トウカイテイオー、\r\nここに推参！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87994e1de79677643a26e5f5703f7c8e1e791bff2cd868318e5911c85d0270f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6707dc9f27d8b18f17ead85c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要全力冲刺咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5cd906cd1a01d0e633db0c49bdeb93737cb6946e4ea3fdb0497c9206285502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a179e2ddf0a6c2bea5fe1977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我的跑姿会\r\n让人感到憧憬……\r\n那姐姐我就会更～加努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8f840d291c425ea55df54bff3ce72af69c95b9f88a8149aa8d0bc9c5b8747b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1004",
        "10000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
